window.products.push({"id":690035,"name":"Rosviocca Artificial Flowers Bulk Dusty Blue Peony Teal Roses Daisy for Wedding Bridal Bouquets Fake Flowers for Decoration Silk Flowers with Stems fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EvjhsKNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Artificial Flowers Combo Pack】As a box of different variety artificial silk flowers for decorations and colorful fake flowers arrangement. Flower heads are made of high quality silk, close to the size of real flowers and look more natural and vivid than plastic flowers. Wire inside the stems, wrapped in green film to simulate the real flower stem material. Which can be bent or cut to fit your DIY shape easily. This is a good choice while you decorating environment. 【What's Included】Green rose x 1, Champagne rose x 2, Austin pink rose x 2, Blue dahlia x 1, Pink coffee peony x 1, Grey peony x 1, Blue chrysanthemum x 2, Dusty blue peony x 2, Pink and white rose ×2, Light green lotus rose ×2, White corn poppy ×2, White mini chamomile ×1, White wavy corn poppy ×1, Green gypsophila ×1, White plum blossom ×1, Big eucalyptus leaf ×3, total 25 pcs. 【Ideal Home Decor & DIY Wedding】Artificial flowers are very easy to work with. Each flower head already has a iron wire stem about 8 inches long installed. They can be easily bent by hand or cut with pliers as needed. You don't need to use tape or a hot melt gun for processing. Each flower box set can make a 9\"-10\" bouquet, or a 11\"-12\" centerpiece. Flower heads and stems are artificially glued. There may be slight color differences or artificial traces. Please don't hesitate to contact us if you have any questions. （PS. Be sure to protect eyes and hands if you need to cut the wire） 【Wide Application】Perfectly matching with other foam roses, greeneries, fake vines, baby breath flowers, hydrangea, artificial roses flowers, flower garland, eucalyptus leaf, cake flowers, flower wreath, ect. For making bride bouquets, core decorations, wall flowers decorations, wreath headband, kissing balls, corsages, bridal shower decorations or any other floral decorations and the arrangement you need in rustic wedding decor, flower centerpieces for tables, parties, baby showers or home. 【Advantages】These fake flower heads won't wilt and don't require any care and maintenance. Are the best choice if people may allergic to flowers, also practical alternative to real florals. These can achieve all kinds of décor you want. Or you can rearrange it occasionally, or keep your bridal bouquet to commemorate that moment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EvjhsKNiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosviocca","source_asin":"B0B526JZ98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B526JZ98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B526JZ98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
