window.products.push({"id":690043,"name":"Don’t Even Ask - Bad Day - Good Day Funny 15oz Stemless Crystal Wine Glass - Fun Wine Glasses with Sayings Gifts for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IH2wXmBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There is no more essential piece of equipment in the wine enthusiast’s arsenal than a good wine glass! We strongly believe that the right glass can have an effect on the enjoyment of any particular bottle. Our High-Quality Crystal Glass is very modern classy and they have a subtle wave along the edge of the bowl which fits very comfortably in your hands making your drinking experience even more enjoyable. What's better than giving a stemless crystal wine glass for a wino or wine lover? Sip happens! to you, your friends, family members and coworkers, so get them with these funny wine glasses since they make a great gift for someone that loves to have a wild time when they are drinking wine. Our crystal Glasses are amazing for occasion such as anniversaries, bachelor and bachelorette parties, Valentine’s Days, Engagements, Christmas, thinking-of-you gifts, you name it! What a better way to make a statement with your girls by cheering with our stemless personalized glass.? Lasting Quality: High-quality, Made from Premium smooth, scratch-resistant Top-Quality lead-free crystal glass for outstanding durability. The Don’t Even Ask - Bad Day - Good Day Design is printed with high grade eco-friendly ink. These glasses can hold plenty of liquid and we believe that when the wine flows, so too does the conversation! Next time you spend with your friend’s toast with our hilarious High-Quality Crystal Glass and blow them away with our designs. Safe for the Microwave and Dishwasher: Wash it in the dishwasher after every use and still never worry about the design fading away or peeling over time. It is also safe to use it on the microwave. Cold and hot temperatures will not affect the high quality of your glass, so you’ll feel confident to use it every day. Carefully Packed, Satisfaction is guaranteed: 100% customer satisfaction is our goal. To make sure each crystal glass arrives at its new home safe and sound. Our durable packaging delivers the high-quality glass to you reliably. If you ever find a craftsmanship or materials defect in any of our glasses, simply contact our friendly and responsive customer service. We stand behind all of our carefully crafted and packed products and will work with you to find a solution that’s pleasing to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IH2wXmBWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CBTwear","source_asin":"B07TBH9Q1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TBH9Q1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TBH9Q1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
