window.products.push({"id":690179,"name":"3 Packs 3 Color Icing Piping Bag Russian Nozzle Converter Coupler Icing Cake Decor Tools","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rncHz3BIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"It is very very easy to use.  How to use:  1. Counterclockwise rotate the colorful cover to make it loose and be separated from other three white parts.  2. Add the piping bags and nozzle as picture shows.   3. Pay attention here, when combine the three white parts, you have to make sure the inner number side fits the same number side together, such as 1 to 1,2 to 2,3 to 3. Do not combine by random. Even though they are very similar, they are not the same direction. What's more, Three different items's parts had better not combined by random. They may not fit each other well. Please try to keep them in original.  4. At last, after making sure the white parts combined right, then just clockwise rotate the colorful cover,make them absolutely tighten. Then you can add different cream or ice cream to the piping bags. Having fun.  If you have any problems, please firstly firstly tell me, I am glad to help you immediately and make you satisfied. Thanks. Material: PVC Quantity: 3pcs Suit for round bottom Russian piping tips nozzle diameter about 1.46 inch, about 3.7cm Functions: The interlocking coupler pieces connect multiple decorating bags, allowing you to swirl 2 or 3 colors together with one simple piping motion. Color: Purple, Green, Pink","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rncHz3BIL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SNOBUOWIN","source_asin":"B01N2KFZAQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2KFZAQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2KFZAQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
