window.products.push({"id":690204,"name":"Florensi Meditation Cushion - Comfortable Floor Pillow - Traditional Crescent Meditation Pillow with Beautiful Velvet Cover - Large Floor Cushion Seat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913scRTIG6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A BEAUTIFUL, COMFORTABLE CUSHION - Available in a range of beautiful colors, our half-moon zafus deliver a calming, restorative energy to your space. Used as a yoga prop to help ease you into certain poses, these are ideal for meditation or yoga practices - or as a floor pillow or chair at home for working/learning. SUPPORT YOUR POSTURE - Our floor pillows place you in a natural seated position. When resting on this comfy cushion, you'll feel less stress on your joints, relieve lower back pain and rid numbness in your hands and feet. These floor cushions support yoga poses, promoting proper posture and a clearer mind. QUALITY MATERIALS - Our meditation pillows measure 16” wide and 5” tall. Each cover is crafted from a soft velvet fabric, with a mandala pattern beautifully embroidered on top. Filled with 100% natural buckwheat hulls, we then place a layer of foam padding to create our ultra-comfortable seat. The cover features a subtle zipper, allowing you to alter the filling to your desired comfort level. The cover can also be removed and washed by hand or on a delicate cycle in the washing machine VERSATILE USE - There is no need to tuck this buckwheat bolster cushion away in a closet or under your bed when not in use! It doubles as a lovely decor piece for your home or yoga studio, a cute accent for your couch or bed, or even as a sleep aid for spine, neck, and limb support. These meditative cushions feature a grab-and-go handle for easy portability to a yoga studio, meditation class, zen garden, or wherever you go to find your peace. THE FLORENSI PROMISE - We feel passionate that yoga and meditation play a crucial role in health and well-being. Through our line of products we strive to promote physical well-being and encourage oneness by connecting the self with nature, resulting in a society full of joy and good health. If you have any trouble, please let us know - we’d be delighted to make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/913scRTIG6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Florensi","source_asin":"B09TTYNTX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTYNTX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTYNTX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":690205,"name":"Furniture of America Crossman Metal Twin Triple Bunk Bed in Sand Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":737.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fwtiRvURS._AC_.jpg","description":"Experience the effortless and delightful style of the sand black and silver finish in this bunk bed. Crafted from metal, it showcases a timeless design. The elegant plank construction defines the bed's look, providing plenty of sleeping room, and the slatted guard rails ensure safety. With its wide upper bed clearance, the bunk bed prevents accidents, and the included slat kit eliminates the need for a box spring. Enjoy a simple and charming addition to your bedroom with this bunk bed.Features :- Includes: One (1) Twin Triple Bunk Bed- Style: Contemporary- Finish: Sand Black- Materials: Steel- Unique L-shaped corner design- Sturdy metal slatted guard rails- Fixed step ladders make it easy to access each bunk- Spacious 28-inch upper bed clearance- Accommodates up to 3 twin size beds- Mattress ready, no box spring required- Full metal construction for lasting endurance- Two-tone design- Upper Bed Clearance: 29\"- Easy to follow step by step assembly guide included.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 79\"L x 78.25\"W x 74.25\"H- Frame Material : Wood- Target Audience : Adult (18 Years and Up)- Surface Material : Metal- Assembly details : Adult Assembly Required, Tools Not Provided- Product Color : Black- Furniture Subtype : Bunk Beds- Product Weight : 154 lbs- Weight Capacity : 300 lbs- Assembly Required : Yes- Warranty Description : 1-Year Manufacture Limited Replacement Parts Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41fwtiRvURS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Furniture of America","source_asin":"B07FFMHV7N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690205","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FFMHV7N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FFMHV7N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
