window.products.push({"id":690303,"name":"GLSLAND Full Length Mirror with Mosaic Style Frame, 65\"x22\" Unique Vanity Rectangle Floor Mirror, Wide Border HD Full Body Mirror for Livingroom and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BwI8pqM3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you plagued by not being able to see your clothes completely in the mirror at home? Are you still looking for a full-length mirror at home that cannot move at will? Our full-length mirrors can solve your problems well. First of all, the 65\"x22\" size mosaic full-length mirror can fully display your entire body from any angle. It can help you better adjust your dress and state before going to work or attending a party . Second, a person's taste is usually reflected in the items in the home. The design of the mosaic frame can not only adapt to a variety of home decoration styles but also add a sense of design to your room. A unique vanity rectangle mirror with a sense of design is also a good choice as a background or prop for taking pictures. Third, the full-length mirror can be placed in a variety of ways. It can be leaned against the wall or hung on the wall to save space. Besides, it can stand alone in any position you like through the bracket. The HD full body mirror can also increase the lighting of the room and enlarge the space visually. Tips: If you have any problem with our full length floor mirror, Please contact the Miroland store immediately, we will help you solve your problem in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BwI8pqM3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLSLAND","source_asin":"B08YN8WL1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YN8WL1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YN8WL1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
