window.products.push({"id":690357,"name":"IMS Spring Tension Shower Curtain Rod Cupboard Bar 102.3''-122'' Curtain Pole Stick 304 Stainless Steel Rod Telescopic Staff Anti Rust No Collapse No ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SX9FvLRuL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"🏠 Contemporary Style Attractive and affordable, the shower curtain tension rod provides a sleek, modern profile, and it comes in frosting black for easy coordinating with surrounding decor. 🏠 Select Quality 1. The shower curtain telescopic rod is made of upgraded 304 stainless steel material, which has a stronger carrying capacity, and the shower curtain rods of 7 different sizes can carry a weight of 11-88.2lbs. Stainless steel rods are not easy to rust and can be used in bathrooms. 2. The tension rod contains a large spring to provide firmer support without collapsing and has a longer service life. 3. The non-slip plastic at both ends can also better protect your walls and make sure that the shower curtain rod can be firmly fixed on the wall, and better protect the wall during disassembly. 🏠 Installation Without Punching 1. Adjust the telescopic pole to be 2-3 inches longer than the wall. 2. Press the left end of the telescopic rod against the wall, then squeeze the right end, use the pulling force to slide it into place, and finally fix the telescopic rod on the wall. 🏠 Various Sizes The shower curtain pull rod provides you with 2colors, 7 different lengths to choose from. We have all you want. 🏠 Diverse Uses 1. Separate cabinet to save space. 2. Wardrobes can be easily divided. 3. Hang your plants in the kitchen window. 4. Small item can also be hung on the practical spring bars. 5. Hang shower curtains or curtains. 🏠 Note Please take the longest dimension marked on the shower curtain rod as the true longest dimension, it cannot be extended. Please purchase according to the size you need. 🏠 100% Service If you have any questions about the product, please contact us immediately and we will reply you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SX9FvLRuL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMS","source_asin":"B08FXHNB5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690357","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FXHNB5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FXHNB5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":690358,"name":"KitchenIQ Pizza Wheel Cutting Sharpener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mtfffXo7L._AC_SL1419_.jpg","description":"From the edge experts at KitchenIQ by smiths, this incredible sharpener realigns the blade of traditional pizza wheels. Dull pizza wheels are quickly and easily sharpened when the pizza wheel is run through the ceramic sharpening rods. These unique ceramic rods quickly realign and polish most pizza wheels. To use, simply roll the wheel back and forth through the sharpening slots. Using moderate pressure, 5-10 rolls through the sharpening slot will maintain and prolong the life of your pizza wheel, and make the task of cutting pizza and pastries easier. The non-slip base and finger area provide added stability and safety while using your sharpener. The pizza wheel sharpener makes a great housewarming gift or gadget for the chef in your life. Only from KitchenIQ. Innovation. Quality. Smart.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mtfffXo7L._AC_SL1419_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenIQ","source_asin":"B00MUT7LUG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690358","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MUT7LUG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MUT7LUG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
