window.products.push({"id":690434,"name":"Pahajim Tablecloth Modern Fashion Spliced Striped Tablecloth Washable Dust-Proof Cotton Linen Stitching Tassel Table Cloth for Rectangle Tables Dining","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714gmQiRaiL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"【ANTI-WRINKLE & ANTI-FADING】- Pahajim tablecloth is made of high-quality linen cotton, which combines the characteristics of strong and durable linen material with the softness and easy stretching of cotton. This gives Pahajim tablecloth a strong anti-wrinkle effect. Pahajim table cloth is also dyeing with new technology and high-quality dyes, good fixing effect, not easy to fade after long time of using and washing. 【EASY TO CLEAN】- Hand washing can better maintain and lengthen the life of the tablecloth on account of cotton and linen texture. Of course, you can also put the tablecloth into the laundry bag and wash it with the gentle gear of the washing machine to avoid the strong throwing; Dryer drying or lay flat to dry; Pahajim cotton linen tablecloths can be easily ironed to make the table cloth more smooth and compliant if necessary. 【STYLISH DESIGN】- Blue and green are the most relaxing colors and this rectangle tablecloth forms a variety of styles based on these two colors: a simple casual style with two-tone stitching, a navy style with vertical stripes and a fresh style with four-color horizontal stitching stripes. Each style is very cute and can bring you a good mood all day. 【MULTIPLE APPLICATION】- Pahajim tablecloth can instantly improve the beauty of the table while protecting the table surface. This multi-functional tablecloth is fashionable and casual, which is very suitable for parties or special festivals to enjoy meals with family and friends. It can also fit for indoor and outdoor occasions such as patio, picnic, gardens, kitchen room, dining room, family room, cafes, special occasions and Christmas holidays. 【TIPS】- Please kindly measure your table before purchasing, the size of table cloth usually larger than the size of the table. We offer 30 days return or exchange service. If you have any dissatisfaction or problems with the product, Contact Us. Pahajim will provide you with the best customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714gmQiRaiL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pahajim","source_asin":"B07XPN919L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XPN919L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XPN919L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
