window.products.push({"id":690635,"name":"Laura Ashley Reversible Crochet Beaded Bath Rug, Blush, 17\" x 24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fdFS00rWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classically chic Laura Ashley Reversible Beaded Crochet Bath Rug Collection features 100% natural cotton rugs in an assortment of rich colors, perfect for elevating any bathroom décor. Each rug is specially woven to resemble beading and finished with a delicately feminine crochet trim. Thick and durable cotton is reversible for long-lasting use. Color options include white, ivory, light gray, charcoal, linen, aqua blue, indigo, and blush pink. Backing is 100% cotton - rug pad or grippers are recommended and sold separately. Machine wash cold separately with mild detergent. Do not bleach. For best results, hang dry. Imported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fdFS00rWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B0B5HRC765","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5HRC765","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5HRC765","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
