window.products.push({"id":690702,"name":"Microfiber Beach Towel Super Lightweight Tropical Island Sea Turtle Bath Sandproof Blanket Multi-Purpose for Travel Swimming Pool Camping Yoga and Gym","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvLAK7bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Lightweight & Compact Long Beach Towel: This is not a traditional camping towel. Compared with ordinary beach towels, our lightweight beach towels are lighter and thinner. So that it is convenient to pack and carry. You can roll up the plush beach towel for travel, camping, hiking. Our lightweight sand- beach towel will bring you a wonderful journey. Dries Easily: Our sandproof beach towel dries three times faster than cotton. All you need to do is to open it in an open area or in your backyard. Imagine you are at a pool party or a long beach trip, when your towel dries faster than anyone else on the clothesline, so you don't have to bring a wet towel home. Sand- Microfiber: Don't let the sand affect your good mood of the day! Just hang the sand- microfiber towel to dry after use or dry it in the sun, and shake the surf beach towel to remove the sand easily! It means that the sand on the beach will not leave messy things in your car or backpack on the way home. Our advantage: 1.Made of high-quality microfiber, with excellent softness and comfort. 2.It has a good touch and high water absorption rate. 3.Lightweight and portable, foldable design, and can be hung and stacked4.Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, with excellent portability. Ideal for beaches, swimming pools, spas, saunas, gyms, yoga, travel, camping, and picnic. Based on all the previous features which fit all the needs of beach use, the main purpose of this towel is to use it on the beach. We hope you these towels can help you enjoy your beach time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XvLAK7bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0B1WLSPM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1WLSPM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1WLSPM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
