window.products.push({"id":690848,"name":"FINPAC Luggage Cup Holder, Travel Free Hand Drink Caddy w/Adjustable Divider for Bottles Coffee Mugs, Roll-on/Carry on Suitcase Handle (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ieK-nkyjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Travel Luggage Cup Holder】It’s a terrible experience trying to hold your coffee gingerly while dragging your carry-on through a crowded airport. This luggage cup holder will help you free your hands. It is convenient for holding water bottles/Coffee Mugs, and Carry-on items. 【Foldable & w/Storage Bag】Comes with a drawstring bag that can store the Travel Drink Bag Cup Holder after use. Then put or hung it on your bag directly. Convenient without taking space! 【Easy to Use & High-quality】All you need to do is insert the bag into the luggage trolley; FINPAC travel luggage cup holder for all Roll-on Suitcase; The internal high-tech materials are leak-proof and heat-insulating; Removable divider can be adjusted to fit different size bottles. 【Multiple-Compartment Pockets】This is not just a drink caddy. The front & back pockets will be convenient for your mobile phone, passport, cash, travel map or small items. The back is equipped with a zipper pocket to prevent your valuables from falling accidentally on the way. 【Perfect Travel Gift】It is a practical gift for flight attendants, businessmen, travelers and somebody you love. Perfect for those who travel a lot. (Perfect for 4 wheeled luggage which keeps the cup straight. Not recommended for two-wheeled luggage as your coffee will spill)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ieK-nkyjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FINPAC","source_asin":"B0B8N14VVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8N14VVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8N14VVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":690849,"name":"NAMES TO REMEMBER What's in a Name? Footprints in The Sand Poem/Verse on Footprints Art Background in English or Español","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W4C3OAGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Poem on the Footprints Art Background is as follows: Footprints In The Sand, One night a man had a dream. He dreamed he was walking along the beach with the Lord. Across the sky flashed scenes from his life. For each scene, he noticed two sets of footprints in the sand; one belonging to him, and the other to the Lord. When the last scene of his life flashed before him, he looked back at the footprints in the sand. He noticed that many times along the path of his life there was only one set of footprints. He also noticed that it happened at the very lowest and saddest times in his life. This really bothered him and he questioned the Lord about it. \"Lord, you said that once I decided to follow you, you'd walk with me all the way. But I have noticed that during the most troublesome times in my life, there is only one set of footprints. I don't understand why when I needed you most you would leave me.\" The Lord replied, \"My precious, precious child, I love you and I would never leave you. During your times of trial and suffering, when you see only one set of footprints... it was then that I carried you.\" Jesus...This is a Beautiful Art Background, sure to please... It will arrive ready for you to frame. You will Need to Purchase a Frame that can hold a 8.5\" X 11\" Photo/Document. This is even more stunning once framed and hanging on the wall... AVAILABLE IN ENGLISH or Español, CLICK CUSTOMIZE TO ENTER WHICH LANGUAGE YOU WOULD LIKE...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+W4C3OAGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAMES TO REMEMBER What's in a Name?","source_asin":"B01DTEK3AA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DTEK3AA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DTEK3AA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
