window.products.push({"id":690871,"name":"Patouque Chair Cushion Memory Foam Seat Pads for Kitchen Dining Chairs 2 Pack - U-Shaped Nonslip Seating Cushions Set 16x14 Inch Thick - Premium Comfo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qDtFCYssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Responsive Memory Foam - Designed in the right thickness, the tufted chair pad strikes a balance between softness and firmness that lasts for years without going flat. Capable of adjusting to individual shape and weight, high-density breathable memory foam is really a lifesaver that helps to improve blood circulation, alleviate back and butt pain and encourage good posture. Get that added comfort to transform regular chairs into places of rest and relaxation. Textured Smooth Surface - Built using 100% polyester upholstery for an stylish look and soft cover, the highly durable padded seat cushion will offer a long-term service just as expected. A honeycomb pattern and lock-stitched rounded edging that’s both casual and trendy will surely fit into any design scheme, making it the perfect pick for kitchen, dining room, bedroom, living room, play room, office, patio, garden, restaurant, sports events, any indoor furnitures or even outdoor activities. Eliminate Slipping - Featuring a anti-skid PVC grip backing, the sophisticated pads don’t shift or slip from wood, metal, and even plastic chairs, turning virtually any chair–or flat surface seat–into a significantly more comfortable sitting experience. No need for those cluttered and old-fashioned ties now. Add extra comfort, style, functionality, and maybe even a bit of flair to your dining chairs with Patouque aesthetically pleasing strapless chair pads. Easy to Care - For a seat cushion that offers a good balance between support and practicality, Patouque fancy seat cushions is a good choice. Simply use mild natural soap and warm water for spot clean. Designed to withstand use after use while keeping you and your guest comfortable for years on end, the wear-resistant chair cushions are totally safe to toss in a washing machine as well when needed. Sit in long-lasting comfort and enjoy your delightful meal time! Standard Size - The 14x16-inch U-shaped design will fit on most universal chairs for great versatility, such as kitchen dining chairs, counter stool, barstools, folding chairs, office chairs or any otherwise uncomfortable seats. Toned in a neutral color of ash gray, Patouque chic seat pads will blend in with any home décor and become a welcome addition to any room that’s in need of an comfy and inviting vibe. Get the best comfort and stability by getting these quality chair cushions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qDtFCYssL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Patouque","source_asin":"B09Z7NQ2S5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-690871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z7NQ2S5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z7NQ2S5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
